OL,3,AMobile payments on the rise but cash
OL,4,Adecline slows
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsumers are increasingly relying on
OL,7,Ftheir mobile phone to make payments
OL,8,Frather than carrying bank cards, new
OL,9,Fdata shows.
OL,11,FTwo-thirds of adults in the UK were
OL,12,Fregistered with at least one mobile
OL,13,Fpayment service last year, according to
OL,14,Fan annual report by banking trade body
OL,15,FUK Finance.
OL,17,FUse of a phone to pay has jumped in
OL,18,Frecent years. It is a decade since
OL,19,FApple Pay was launched in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
