OL,3,AMobile payments on the rise but cash
OL,4,Adecline slows
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile cash use continues to decline,
OL,7,Fthe data suggests that the fall is
OL,8,Fslowing and that notes and coins will
OL,9,Fremain an important payment option for
OL,10,Fmany people a decade from now.
